--- the page draw routines (page 0 basic / text 0x438ef0, page 1 sound 0x438240, page 2 character voices 0x438a60,
--- common tabs 0x43b490; drawSprite 0x432230, stretched draw 0x432710), the input routine (0x439b00..) and the
--- defaults (0x438030..). All art is on CONFIG.DDS (system.mpk id 5); its texts are part of the (localised) sheet.
--- The game computes in 1280x720 units and draws at x1.5; values below are already in 1920x1080 units.
---   * a background (0, 0, 1920 x 1080), per page a paper sheet (954 x 916) at (83, 95) and a button guide at (97, 987);
